@startuml getLocalAddress
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

title
getLocalAddress – Retrieve Local TCP Server Address
end title

participant "requestor" as requestor
participant "TCP Server Resolver" as tsr #LightCyan
participant "JSON Driver" as jd #LightYellow
participant "config.json" as cfg #LightGrey

note over requestor
  retrieve the local address of the application
end note

requestor -> tsr: (none)
activate tsr

tsr -> jd: read logical-termination-points
activate jd

jd <-> cfg: retrieve control-construct

jd --> tsr: TCP server LTP list
deactivate jd

note over tsr
  <u>Processing</u>
  - Iterate through TCP server interface 
  - Read tcp-server-interface-configuration  
      * local-address  
  - Return local address value  
  - Return undefined if not configured
end note

tsr --> requestor: localAddress | undefined
deactivate tsr

@enduml
